What you describe may work well for vanilla. In fact, I also have
standard letters for my bag of holding (u for historical reasons) and my
sack (v), though not for a wand of cancellation.

In slash'em, it is not advisable at all to carry your wand of
cancellation openly in your inventory. If it explodes, because you were
hit by a wand of lightning, everything in your inventory is cancelled.
This behaviour is different from vanilla.

